{"id":"36e551ab24e0c1bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-bilinear-form.md","title":"Bilinear Form","display":"df-bilinear-form — Bilinear Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bilinear-form","aliases":["58-df-bilinear-form","Bilinear Form"],"display":"df-bilinear-form — Bilinear Form","depends_on":["[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bilinear-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bilinear-form</span><span>Bilinear Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bilinear-form — Bilinear Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BilinForm}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{BilinForm}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,W,k\\in V\">\\(B,W,k\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> (field-structure-explicit vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BilinForm}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BilinForm}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\mathrm{BilinForm}_S(B,W,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,W\\times W,k)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in W\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\bigl(B(x+_Wy,z)=B(x,z)+_kB(y,z)\\land B(x,y+_Wz)=B(x,y)+_kB(x,z)\\land B(\\alpha\\odot_Wx,y)=\\alpha\\cdot_kB(x,y)\\land B(x,\\alpha\\odot_Wy)=\\alpha\\cdot_kB(x,y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\mathrm{BilinForm}_S(B,W,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,W\\times W,k)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in W\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\bigl(B(x+_Wy,z)=B(x,z)+_kB(y,z)\\land B(x,y+_Wz)=B(x,y)+_kB(x,z)\\land B(\\alpha\\odot_Wx,y)=\\alpha\\cdot_kB(x,y)\\land B(x,\\alpha\\odot_Wy)=\\alpha\\cdot_kB(x,y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bilinear: linear in each argument separately.  Both linearity laws now use the same exposed field structure as the vector-space predicate, rather than an unrelated existential field structure hidden by the compatibility projection.</li>\n<li>Symmetric: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,y) = B(y,x)\">\\(B(x,y) = B(y,x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Alternating: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,x) = 0 \\;\\forall x\">\\(B(x,x) = 0 \\;\\forall x\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples: dot product, symplectic form</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Roman, Advanced Linear Algebra</li>\n<li>Axler, Linear Algebra Done Right</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S$ (field-structure-explicit vector-space predicate, see [[58-df-vector-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BilinForm}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{8}","display":false},{"tex":"B,W,k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BilinForm}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear\\text{-}form} \\vdash \\mathrm{BilinForm}_S(B,W,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(W,k,+_W,\\odot_W,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B,W\\times W,k)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in W\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in k\\;\\bigl(B(x+_Wy,z)=B(x,z)+_kB(y,z)\\land B(x,y+_Wz)=B(x,y)+_kB(x,z)\\land B(\\alpha\\odot_Wx,y)=\\alpha\\cdot_kB(x,y)\\land B(x,\\alpha\\odot_Wy)=\\alpha\\cdot_kB(x,y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"B(x,y) = B(y,x)","display":false},{"tex":"B(x,x) = 0 \\;\\forall x","display":false}],"bytes":1779,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5688830fcd4f86b","anc